    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search on the answer</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy check</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/capacity-to-ship-packages-within-d-days/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1011</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Capacity To Ship Packages Within D Days</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Do not search the parcels, search the capacity. \"Can capacity c ship everything in D days?\" is a greedy O(n) check, and it is monotone: if c works, every bigger c works. Binary search the first working c between max(weights) and sum(weights): O(n log(sum)) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
  },
